    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;Slot &amp; Dungeons&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.poster.avif?t=1750231149\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.webm?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.mp4?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot &amp; Dungeons is a solo deck-building roguelike where enemy and item placements change based on slot mechanics. Strategically use your attacks and skills to defeat enemies, leveling up to enhance your abilities as you explore deeper into the dungeon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Symbols&quot; to build slots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.poster.avif?t=1750231149\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.webm?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.mp4?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies along the way and resources needed to conquer the dungeon will be incorporated into the slot draw as &quot;symbols&quot;.<br>Symbols can be obtained by stepping on each floor or by various effects in the floor. <br>The symbols are obtained when players step on each floor or by various effects in the dungeon! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Type of Symbols&quot;</strong><br><strong>Spell</strong>: Triggered after the slot is drawn, these have various effects on the floor. <br><strong>Items</strong>: Placed on floor tiles, these activate when picked up or approached. <br><strong>Enemies</strong>: These adversaries are out to get you. Study their characteristics and find the key to defeating them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/dabb103b965cf2ef4450860092a367f8.poster.avif?t=1750231149\" width=630 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/dabb103b965cf2ef4450860092a367f8.webm?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/dabb103b965cf2ef4450860092a367f8.mp4?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In Slot &amp; Dungeons, you choose one of several characters to take on the dungeon challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique abilities and symbols, such as <strong>the Warrior</strong>, who excels at melee attacks and high durability, and <strong>the Mage</strong>, who specializes in spell-based extermination.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is &quot;Slot &amp; Dungeons&quot;?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.poster.avif?t=1750231149\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.webm?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/bbadd0028e376876b804c4b01df9cae5.mp4?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot &amp; Dungeons is a solo deck-building roguelike where enemy and item placements change based on slot mechanics. Strategically use your attacks and skills to defeat enemies, leveling up to enhance your abilities as you explore deeper into the dungeon!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Symbols&quot; to build slots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.poster.avif?t=1750231149\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.webm?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160090/extras/a85c4e75919df23abcb559aa7668a240.mp4?t=1750231149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies along the way and resources needed to conquer the dungeon will be incorporated into the slot draw as &quot;symbols&quot;.<br>Symbols can be obtained by stepping on each floor or by various effects in the floor. <br>The symbols 